WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.458 --> 00:00:01.209
What's it like?

00:00:01.584 --> 00:00:02.460
Always knowing the truth.

00:00:04.337 --> 00:00:07.173
There's nothing mystical about it. I can just tell.

00:00:07.215 --> 00:00:08.341
When anyone is lying?

00:00:08.425 --> 00:00:08.967
Yeah.

00:00:13.138 --> 00:00:15.140
I know what you 
did here psycho.

00:00:17.809 --> 00:00:19.352
You're gonna find 
Charlie Cale

00:00:19.728 --> 00:00:20.979
and you're gonna
bring her to me.

00:00:27.444 --> 00:00:28.570
You live on the road, right?

00:00:28.570 --> 00:00:30.739
What's it like, to leave 
everything behind, 

00:00:30.739 --> 00:00:31.656
start fresh?

00:00:32.782 --> 00:00:34.617
I've got wolves on my fender.

00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:36.369
I gotta keep moving.

00:00:37.537 --> 00:00:38.705
Holy. Holy.

00:00:40.623 --> 00:00:43.001
It wasn’t an accident. I- I think there’s been a murder.

00:00:47.130 --> 00:00:47.756
Look out!

00:00:51.885 --> 00:00:53.845
I have been kind of 
a death magnet.

00:00:56.639 --> 00:00:57.223
Ahh!

00:00:59.225 --> 00:01:00.060
I’m trying to figure 
out what happened.

00:01:01.644 --> 00:01:02.645
You watch too 
much Dateline.

00:01:02.979 --> 00:01:04.064
I could tell she was lying.

00:01:04.272 --> 00:01:06.232
So what is this, a 
woman’s intuition?

00:01:06.232 --> 00:01:08.568
No, it’s not like a tampon 
commercial, okay?

00:01:08.568 --> 00:01:09.486
It’s a real thing.

00:01:18.578 --> 00:01:19.579
You’re coming with me.

00:01:19.579 --> 00:01:20.872
Front seat or the trunk.

00:01:21.164 --> 00:01:22.082
Your choice.

00:01:35.178 --> 00:01:36.513
I guess I’m not over 
the part where

00:01:36.513 --> 00:01:38.056
you’re a human lie detector.

00:01:38.056 --> 00:01:40.183
Yeah, I know. It’s 
uh- it’s crazy.

00:01:40.266 --> 00:01:42.018
You ever gamble? Cause 
you could make a killing.

00:01:44.646 --> 00:01:45.647
Nah.

